---

<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.homeMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches ? 'reduced' : 'enabled';
</script>

<section class="home-hero" aria-labelledby="home-hero-title">
  <div class="home-shell home-hero__inner">
    <div class="home-hero__copy">
      <p class="home-eyebrow">Piano Teacher · Music Educator</p>
      <h1 id="home-hero-title">讓每個人都能找到<br />自己的音樂</h1>
      <p class="home-hero__lead">林美杏老師以逾四十年的教學經驗，陪伴孩子、成人與樂齡學員，從基礎開始，找到適合自己的學習方式。</p>
      <ul class="home-hero__pillars">
        <li>鋼琴與樂理教學</li>
        <li>合唱、歌唱與伴奏</li>
        <li>樂齡音樂與志工服務</li>
